--8<-- [start:description]

Shortcuts are defined by the package itself, using [menuinst](https://conda.github.io/menuinst/).
Packages that don't define any can't get a shortcut.

What gets created depends on the platform:

- **Windows**: Start Menu entries and, by default, a Desktop shortcut.
- **macOS**: An `.app` bundle in `~/Applications`, which shows up in Launchpad and Spotlight.
- **Linux**: `.desktop` entries in the application menu.

Packages can also register file type associations.
See [Shortcuts](../../../../../global_tools/manifest.md#shortcuts) for how shortcuts are stored in the global manifest.

